<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"All_Goods_Information">All Goods Info=
rmation</span><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><span class=3D"mw-editsection-=
bracket">[</span><a title=3D"Sign in to edit" class=3D"mw-editsection-visua=
leditor" data-tracking-label=3D"log-in-edit-section" data-action=3D"edit-se=
ction" href=3D"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Ftown=
ship.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGoods%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=
=3Den&amp;metadata=3Darticle-registration-edit-article-section" data-testid=
=3D"log-in-edit-section" aria-label=3D"Sign in to edit"><svg class=3D"wds-i=
con wds-icon-tiny" aria-hidden=3D"true" focusable=3D"false"><use xlink:href=
=3D"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny"></use></svg></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-b=
racket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>This page lists all goods and products that can be stored in your <a hre=
f=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Barn" title=3D"Barn">barn</a>, interf=
ace (<a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Gems" title=3D"Gems">gems<=
/a>) or the mine's <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Mine" title=
=3D"Mine">warehouse</a>. Goods from the barn and warehouse can be sold. But=
 some goods cannot be sold. Most goods will be sent to the barn when you co=
llect them from <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Fields" title=
=3D"Fields">fields</a>, <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Factori=
es" title=3D"Factories">factories</a>, <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.c=
om/wiki/Train" title=3D"Train">trains</a>, <a href=3D"https://township.fand=
om.com/wiki/Ships" title=3D"Ships">ships</a>, the <a href=3D"https://townsh=
ip.fandom.com/wiki/City_Market" title=3D"City Market">city market</a> and t=
he <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Zoo" title=3D"Zoo">zoo</a>. =
Most filled <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Co-op" class=3D"mw-=
redirect" title=3D"Co-op">co-op</a> requests and <a href=3D"https://townshi=
p.fandom.com/wiki/House_of_Luck" title=3D"House of Luck">House of Luck</a> =
winnings go to your barn automatically. Most of your goods can be used to m=
ake other products in the <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Facto=
ries" title=3D"Factories">factories</a>. Tap on the product's image in your=
 factory to see what component goods are required.
</p><p>Ore is stored in, and can be sold from, the mine's <a href=3D"https:=
//township.fandom.com/wiki/Mine" title=3D"Mine">warehouse</a>. <a href=3D"h=
ttps://township.fandom.com/wiki/Foundry" title=3D"Foundry">Ingots</a> are s=
tored in the barn. Mining tools are not for sale; they are only expended by=
 use in the mine or by filling co-op requests for those items.
</p><p><a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Gems" title=3D"Gems">Gem=
s</a> are collected from planes, the mine and the zoo. They cannot be sold =
for coins, but can be spent at the <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/w=
iki/Laboratory" title=3D"Laboratory">Laboratory</a>, for buying Zoo cards a=
t the <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Zoo" title=3D"Zoo">Zoo</a=
>, and buying <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Decoration_Table_=
by_type" title=3D"Decoration Table by type">Special Decorations</a> such as=
 the Eiffel Tower, Burj Khalifa, Leaning Tower of Pisa etc.
</p><p>Once in the <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Barn" title=
=3D"Barn">barn</a> or <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Mine" tit=
le=3D"Mine">warehouse</a>, goods can be sold for a fixed coin amount (price=
s are listed in the tables below). You can earn <a href=3D"https://township=
.fandom.com/wiki/Coin" title=3D"Coin">coin</a> and experience by filling <a=
 href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Helicopter" title=3D"Helicopter">=
helicopter</a> orders, filling <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/=
Airport" title=3D"Airport">airplane</a> crates, completing <a href=3D"https=
://township.fandom.com/wiki/Zoo" title=3D"Zoo">Zoo</a> Orders, sharing good=
s with your <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Co-op" class=3D"mw-=
redirect" title=3D"Co-op">co-op</a> members, and filling friends' <a href=
=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Airport" title=3D"Airport">plane</a>/<=
a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Train" title=3D"Train">train</a>=
 crates. Your <a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Train" title=3D"T=
rain">trains</a> also require goods to be sent off, but you will only get e=
xperience points (<a href=3D"https://township.fandom.com/wiki/Xp" title=3D"=
Xp">Xp</a>), building materials, and mining tools in return. After Level 60=
, you require a Special Building called the <a href=3D"https://township.fan=
dom.com/wiki/Tool_Exchange" title=3D"Tool Exchange">Tool Exchange</a> in wh=
ich special tools can be bought by exchanging them with <a href=3D"https://=
township.fandom.com/wiki/Construction_Materials" title=3D"Construction Mate=
rials">Construction Materials</a>.
</p>
